{
  "headline": "FDA's records trace our supply to a plant classified OAI 148 days after the posting",
  "headline_cites": ["D5"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA first posted the sterile water injection shortage on 2021-11-23 and it remains current as of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["E45", "D11"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Nephron SC, LLC is the registered plant on the label for sterile water 1 mL/mL 5 mL vial (NDC 00487610501).",
      "cites": ["E34"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection 1167490 at Nephron SC, LLC ended 2022-04-20 and was classified OAI with observations including validation lacking for sterile drug products.",
      "cites": ["E20"]
    },
    {
      "text": "That OAI classification occurred 148 days after FDA posted the shortage on 2021-11-23.",
      "cites": ["D5"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Subsequent inspections at the same plant in 2023-02-10, 2024-02-09, and 2024-09-25 were also classified OAI.",
      "cites": ["E23", "E25", "E27"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Two Class II recalls by Nephron Sc Inc for sterile water injection were initiated in 2023-01-12 and 2023-02-23 citing CGMP deviations and potential product carryover.",
      "cites": ["E35", "E36"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The rule‑based best option is to buy from Chartwell RX, LLC, which is not on FDA's shortage list today.",
      "cites": ["D12"]
    }
  ]
}
